---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="Projects" 
  description="Software development, leadership programs, and wellness initiatives"
>

  <section class="hero" style="min-height: 50vh;">
    <div class="hero-content">
      <h1>Projects</h1>
      <p class="tagline">Building Solutions That Matter</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div style="max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto;">

<!-- Stronger Together - Complete A3 Example -->
<div class="project-container" id="stronger-together">
  <div class="project-title">
    <span class="project-category">Leadership Development</span>
    <h2>Stronger Together</h2>
    <p class="project-subtitle">A physician leadership program using rowing as a vehicle for team building</p>
  </div>

  <!-- Carousel wrapper (replaces .a3-grid) -->
  <div class="a3-carousel" data-embla>
    <div class="a3-carousel__controls">
      <button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary" data-prev aria-label="Previous card">←</button>

      <div class="embla__dots" data-dots aria-label="Card navigation"></div>

      <button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary" data-next aria-label="Next card">→</button>
    </div>

    <div class="embla__viewport">
      <div class="embla__container">

        <!-- Slide 1 -->
        <div class="embla__slide">
          <div class="a3-card problem-card">
            <div class="card-number">1</div>
            <h3>Problem</h3>
            <p>
              Coming out of the pandemic, we had burned out leaders with no local tools to reconnect
              them with the "why" behind their work or inspire their teams. Healthcare professionals
              were struggling with isolation, exhaustion, and loss of purpose in their calling.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Slide 2 -->
        <div class="embla__slide">
          <div class="a3-card current-card">
            <div class="card-number">2</div>
            <h3>Current State</h3>
            <p>
              The Darden School offered a leadership course using rowing, but it didn't focus on
              physicians or connect with the medical field's unique challenges. The course was also
              a week long, making it difficult for busy clinicians to attend.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Slide 3 -->
        <div class="embla__slide">
          <div class="a3-card solution-card">
            <div class="card-number">3</div>
            <h3>Solution</h3>
            <p>
              We drew from collective rowing and clinical experience to build a shorter, focused
              course specifically for clinicians. The 2.5-day immersive program combined classroom
              sessions on high-performing teams with hands-on rowing experience, creating space for
              physicians to learn about leadership while physically experiencing teamwork.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Slide 4 -->
        <div class="embla__slide">
          <div class="a3-card outcomes-card">
            <div class="card-number">4</div>
            <h3>Reflection & Outcomes</h3>
            <p>
              In just a few days, we developed a group that could row all 8 together for 500 meters.
              Participants walked away with new skills for engaging their teams and dramatically
              improved leadership engagement.
            </p>

            <div class="outcomes-visual">
              <img src="/images/stronger-together-outcomes.png" alt="Burnout and Engagement Outcomes" />
            </div>

            <blockquote class="participant-quote">
              "Finally, and this is probably the most important. The course made me feel less isolated
              and alone. By taking this course with leaders OUTSIDE my normal day/life/work etc it made
              me feel part of something bigger. It also gave me a different network that I feel like I
              can tap into the next time I'm feeling like I'm struggling."
              <cite>— Pilot Program Participant</cite>
            </blockquote>

            <div class="project-status-badge">
              <strong>Status:</strong> Pilot completed • Available for custom cohorts
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
