                Participants walked away with new skills for engaging their teams and dramatically 
                improved leadership engagement.
              </p>
              
              <div class="outcomes-visual">
                <img src="/images/stronger-together-outcomes.png" alt="Burnout and Engagement Outcomes" />
              </div>

              <blockquote class="participant-quote">
                "Finally, and this is probably the most important. The course made me feel less isolated 
