                <cite>— Pilot Program Participant</cite>
              </blockquote>

              <div class="project-status-badge">
                <strong>Status:</strong> Pilot completed • Available for custom cohorts
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="project-footer">
            <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary">Inquire About Stronger Together</a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- FacultyHub - Template (to be filled in) -->
        <div class="project-container" id="facultyhub">
          <div class="project-title">
            <span class="project-category">Healthcare Operations</span>
            <h2>FacultyHub</h2>
            <p class="project-subtitle">Automated scheduling for academic medical centers</p>
          </div>

          <div class="a3-grid">
            <div class="a3-card problem-card">
              <div class="card-number">1</div>
              <h3>Problem</h3>
              <p>
                [To be filled: What scheduling challenges were faculty facing?]
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="a3-card current-card">
              <div class="card-number">2</div>
              <h3>Current State</h3>
              <p>
                [To be filled: What was the manual scheduling process like?]
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="a3-card solution-card">
              <div class="card-number">3</div>
              <h3>Solution</h3>
              <p>
                Point-based bidding system with automated conflict detection, equitable time-off 
                allocation, and real-time schedule management.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="a3-card outcomes-card">
              <div class="card-number">4</div>
              <h3>Reflection & Outcomes</h3>
              <p>
                Currently deployed at UVA Health Division of Pulmonary and Critical Care Medicine.
              </p>
              <div class="project-status-badge">
                <strong>Status:</strong> Deployed at UVA Health
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="project-footer">
            <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-secondary">Request a Demo</a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- JamboHub - Template -->
        <div class="project-container" id="jambohub">
          <div class="project-title">
            <span class="project-category">Event Management</span>
            <h2>JamboHub</h2>
            <p class="project-subtitle">Communication platform for large-scale Scout events</p>
          </div>

          <div class="a3-grid">
            <div class="a3-card problem-card">
              <div class="card-number">1</div>
              <h3>Problem</h3>
              <p>
                [To be filled: What communication challenges exist at Jamborees?]
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="a3-card current-card">
              <div class="card-number">2</div>
              <h3>Current State</h3>
              <p>
                [To be filled: What tools are currently used and their limitations?]
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="a3-card solution-card">
              <div class="card-number">3</div>
              <h3>Solution</h3>
              <p>
                Centralized platform for schedules, announcements, emergency communications, and 
                participant tracking across multiple locations.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="a3-card outcomes-card">
              <div class="card-number">4</div>
              <h3>Reflection & Outcomes</h3>
              <p>
                [To be filled: Vision for how this will improve Jamboree coordination]
              </p>
              <div class="project-status-badge">
                <strong>Status:</strong> Concept development
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="project-footer">
            <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-secondary">Learn More</a>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" id="rekindling" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(127, 176, 105, 0.1), rgba(255, 107, 53, 0.1));">
    <div class="container">
      <div style="max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto;">
        <h2 style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; color: var(--primary-green); font-size: 1.5rem;">The Rekindling Project</h2>
        <p style="text-align: center; color: var(--text-light); margin-bottom: 2rem;">
          Moving beyond burnout to rediscover purpose, joy, and sustainable practice.
        </p>
        
        <div class="card">
          <p>
            The Rekindling Project emerged from personal experience with burnout and the realization 
            that recovery isn't about becoming more efficient—it's about rediscovering what makes 
            work meaningful. Rather than teaching resilience, I focus on helping professionals 
            rekindle the spark that drew them to their calling in the first place.
          </p>
          <div style="margin-top: 1.5rem; text-align: center;">
            <a href="/writing" class="btn btn-primary">Read My Writing</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" style="background-color: var(--light-gray);">
    <div class="container">
      <div style="max-width: 700px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center;">
        <h2 style="margin-bottom: 1rem; color: var(--primary-green); font-size: 1.5rem;">Collaborate on a Project</h2>
        <p style="color: var(--text-light); margin-bottom: 2rem;">
          Have an idea for a project or want to learn more about any of these initiatives? 
          I'm always interested in meaningful collaborations.
        </p>
        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary">Get in Touch</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<script src="../scripts/embla-init.ts"></script>

<style>
  .project-container {
    margin-bottom: 4rem;
    padding-bottom: 3rem;
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--light-gray);
  }

  .project-container:last-of-type {
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  .project-title {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .project-category {
    display: inline-block;
    background: var(--light-green);
    color: white;
    padding: 0.35rem 0.85rem;
    border-radius: 20px;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .project-title h2 {
    font-size: 2rem;
    color: var(--text-dark);
    margin: 0.5rem 0;
  }

  .project-subtitle {
    color: var(--text-light);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-style: italic;
    margin: 0.5rem 0 0;
  }

  /* A3 Grid Layout */
  .a3-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .a3-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }

  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .a3-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    }
  }
/* --- A3 Carousel (replaces grid when you want 1 card at a time) --- */
.a3-carousel__controls {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  gap: 0.75rem;
  margin-bottom: 1rem;
}

.embla__viewport {
  overflow: hidden;
}

/* IMPORTANT: your .card-number is top:-12px; give slide a bit of top padding
   so it doesn't get clipped by overflow:hidden */
.embla__slide {
  flex: 0 0 100%;
  padding: 16px 0; /* top padding prevents badge clipping */
  display: flex;
  justify-content: center; /* centers the card */
}

.embla__container {
  display: flex;
}

.embla__slide .a3-card {
  width: 100%;
  max-width: 760px; /* keeps it readable on desktop */
}

/* dots */
.embla__dots {
  display: flex;
  gap: 0.4rem;
  align-items: center;
}

.embla__dot {
  width: 10px;
  height: 10px;
  border-radius: 999px;
  border: 1px solid var(--text-light);
  background: transparent;
  padding: 0;
  cursor: pointer;
}

.embla__dot.is-active {
  background: var(--primary-green);
  border-color: var(--primary-green);
}
  /* A3 Cards */
  .a3-card {
    background: white;
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
    position: relative;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    min-height: 280px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .a3-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-3px);
    box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
  }

  /* Card Number Badge */
  .card-number {
    position: absolute;
    top: -12px;
    left: 1.5rem;
    width: 32px;
    height: 32px;
    background: var(--primary-green);
    color: white;
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
  }

  /* Card Type Colors */
  .problem-card {
    border-top: 4px solid #e74c3c;
  }

  .current-card {
    border-top: 4px solid #f39c12;
  }

  .solution-card {
    border-top: 4px solid #3498db;
  }

  .outcomes-card {
    border-top: 4px solid #27ae60;
  }

  .outcomes-card .card-number {
    background: #27ae60;
  }

  .a3-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--text-dark);
    margin: 0.5rem 0 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .a3-card p {
    color: var(--text-light);
    line-height: 1.6;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    flex-grow: 1;
  }

  /* Outcomes Card Special Styling */
  .outcomes-visual {
    margin: 1.5rem 0;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .outcomes-visual img {
    max-width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    border-radius: 8px;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
  }

  .participant-quote {
    background: var(--light-gray);
    padding: 1.25rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--text-dark);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin: 1.5rem 0;
    border-left: 4px solid var(--primary-orange);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  .participant-quote cite {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
    font-style: normal;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--primary-green);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  .project-status-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    background: white;
    border: 2px solid var(--light-green);
    color: var(--text-dark);
    padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
    border-radius: 20px;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  /* Outcomes card needs to be taller on desktop */
  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .outcomes-card {
      grid-column: span 2;
      min-height: 280px;
    }
  }

  .project-footer {
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }

  /* Mobile: Stack cards vertically */
  @media (max-width: 767px) {
    .a3-card {
      min-height: auto;
    }
    
    .outcomes-card {
      min-height: auto;
    }
  }
</style>
